{
  "kanda": "sundara",
  "sarga": 25,
  "title": "Seetha bursts into a wail",
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.valmikiramayan.net/utf8/sundara/sarga25/sundarasans25.htm",
  "romanUrl": "https://www.valmikiramayan.net/utf8/sundara/sarga25/sundaraitrans25.htm",
  "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy",
  "introduction": [
    "Seetha calls out Rama and others and bursts into a wail not being able to endure the threats of ogre women."
  ],
  "closing": [
    "इत्यार्षे श्रीमद्रामायणे आदिकाव्ये सुन्दरकाण्डे पञ्चविंशः सर्गः",
    "Thus completes 25th Chapter of Sundara Kanda of the glorious Ramayana of Valmiki, the work of a sage and the oldest epic."
  ],
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "5.25.1",
      "label": "5.25.1",
      "numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "devanagari": "अथ तासां वदन्तीनां परुषं दारुणं बहु |\nराक्षसीनामसौम्यानां रुरोद जनकात्मजा",
      "iast": "atha tāsāṃ vadantīnāṃ paruṣaṃ dāruṇaṃ bahu |\nrākṣasīnāmasaumyānāṃ ruroda janakātmajā",
