    {
      "id": "5.25.2",
      "label": "5.25.2",
      "numbers": [
        2
      ],
      "devanagari": "एवमुक्ता तु वैदेही राक्षसीभिर्मनस्विनी |\nउवाच परमत्रस्ताबाष्पगद्गदया गिरा",
      "iast": "evamuktā tu vaidehī rākṣasībhirmanasvinī |\nuvāca paramatrastābāṣpagadgadayā girā",
      "translation": "Thus being spoken to by ogre women, Seetha with a good mind being frightened a lot spoke as follows with a voice indistinct due to tears.",
