    {
      "id": "5.25.4",
      "label": "5.25.4",
      "numbers": [
        4
      ],
      "devanagari": "सा राक्षसीमध्यगता सीता सुरसुतोपमा |\nन शर्म लेभे दुःखार्ता रावणेन च तर्जिता",
      "iast": "sā rākṣasīmadhyagatā sītā surasutopamā |\nna śarma lebhe duḥkhārtā rāvaṇena ca tarjitā",
      "translation": "Being in the middle of ogre women, being frightened by Ravana also, like a daughter of gods, that Seetha did not get comfort being tormented by grief.",
